msgstr ""
"O comando <guimenuitem>Girar 180°</guimenuitem> gira as camadas selecionadas"
" em 180° em torno do centro das camadas, sem perda de dados de pixel."

#: src/menus/layer/rotate-180.xml:26(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "The <guimenuitem>Rotate 180°</guimenuitem> command rotates the active layer "
#| "by 180° around the center of the layer, with no loss of pixel data. The "
#| "shape of the layer is not altered. Since the layers have a rectangular "
#| "shape, a 180° rotation only invert them and they can't extend beyond the "
#| "image limits."
msgid ""
"The shape of the layer is not altered. Since the layers have a rectangular "
"shape, a 180° rotation only inverts them and they can't extend beyond the "
"image limits."
msgstr ""
"A forma da camada não é alterada. Como as camadas têm forma retangular, uma "
