#| msgid "Duplicate Layer"
msgid "Duplicate Layers"
msgstr "Duplicar camada"

#: src/menus/layer/duplicate.xml:24(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "The <guimenuitem>Duplicate Layer</guimenuitem> command adds a new layer to "
#| "the image which is a nearly identical copy of the active layer. The name of "
#| "the new layer is the same as the name of the original layer, but with "
#| "<quote> copy</quote> appended to it."
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Duplicate Layers</guimenuitem> command adds a copy of each "
"selected layer to the image. The name of each new layer is the same as the "
"name of the original layer, but with <quote>copy</quote> or a number "
"appended to it."
msgstr ""
"O comando <guimenuitem>Duplicar camadas</guimenuitem> adiciona uma cópia de "
"cada camada selecionada à imagem. O nome de cada nova camada é o mesmo da "
"camada original, mas com <quote>cópia</quote> ou um número acrescentado."

#: src/menus/layer/duplicate.xml:30(para)
msgid ""
"Note that if there are any <link linkend=\"glossary-"
"parasite\">parasites</link> attached to the selected layers, they are not "
"duplicated."
msgstr ""
"Observe que, se houver <link linkend=\"glossary-parasite\">parasitas</link> "
"anexados às camadas selecionadas, eles não são duplicados."

#: src/menus/layer/duplicate.xml:39(para)
